# VHS Demo for Loopflow

Output docs/demo.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 900
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20

Type "# Loopflow: run LLM agents from reusable prompts"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Type "lf --help"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "lf run --help"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "wt --help"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "# That's it! Write tasks as .lf files, run with 'lf <task>'"
Enter
Sleep 2s
